OL,5,G1850 Grand Designs
OL,6,     FPaul Rimmer has worked with bricks
OL,7,     Ffor 40 years, renovating Victorian
OL,8,     Fhouses in Bolton. But now he plans
OL,9,     Fto hand-build his own
OL,10,     Fstate-of-the-art wooden home - if
OL,11,     Fhis funding holds up.
OL,12,G1955 Grand Designs
OL,13,     FKevin McCloud catches up with the
OL,14,     Fstory of a daring modernist home
OL,15,     Fthat Gil and Hillary Briffa
OL,16,     Fstarted building 10 years
OL,17,     Fpreviously in the Andalusian hills
OL,18,     Fin southern Spain.
